    rdfs:label "St. Dominic receives the commission to preach: St. Peter and St. Paul appear to him in a vision and give him a staff and a book (the gospels) (Iconclass 11H(DOMINIC)342)"@en,
        "San Domenico riceve l'incarico di predicare: San Pietro e San Paolo gli appaiono in visione e gli donano un bastone e un libro (i vangeli) (Iconclass 11H(DOMINIC)342)"@it ;
    dcterms:description "Iconclass code representing Saint Dominic receiving the commission to preach. Saints Peter and Paul appear to him in a vision and present him with a staff and the Book of the Gospels."@en,
        "Codice Iconclass per la rappresentazione di San Domenico che riceve l'incarico di predicare. San Pietro e San Paolo gli appaiono in visione e gli donano un bastone e il libro dei vangeli."@it ;
    crm:P138i_has_representation :vi_detail_vision_saints_peter_paul ;
