:peter_ferrand a crm:E21_Person,
        owl:NamedIndividual,
        rico:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Peter Ferrand"@en,
        "Pietro Ferrandi"@it ;
    dcterms:description "Spanish hagiographer and author of the first official liturgical *Legenda* of Saint Dominic (c. 1235–1238); he supplemented the work of Jordan by framing it within an eschatological context and was the first to introduce the account of the spiritual testament and the curse against anyone who introduced temporal property into the Order."@en,
        "Agiografo spagnolo autore della prima Legenda liturgica ufficiale di san Domenico (c. 1235-1238); integrò l'opera di Giordano proiettandola in un quadro escatologico e introdusse per primo il racconto del testamento spirituale e della maledizione contro chi introducesse proprietà temporali nell'Ordine."@it ;
    crm:P107i_is_current_or_former_member_of :dominican_order,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q131479> ;
    owl:sameAs <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q23619886> ;
    skos:exactMatch <https://viaf.org/en/viaf/311283097> ;
    arco-cd:isAuthorOf :legenda_petri_ferrandi .

